@startuml "Accès aux ressources protégées - Diagramme de séquence"

title Accès aux ressources protégées avec validation JWT

actor "Utilisateur" as User
participant "Frontend\n(Next.js)" as Frontend
participant "API Gateway\n(Rate Limiter)" as API
participant "Auth Controller" as AuthCtrl
participant "Auth Service" as AuthSvc
participant "User Service" as UserSvc
participant "Dashboard Controller" as DashboardCtrl
participant "Database\n(PostgreSQL)" as DB

== Accès aux ressources protégées ==
User -> Frontend: Accéder au dashboard
activate Frontend
Frontend -> API: GET /api/dashboard
note right: Header: Authorization: Bearer {token}
activate API

API -> AuthCtrl: verifyToken(token)
activate AuthCtrl

AuthCtrl -> AuthSvc: validateJWT(token)
activate AuthSvc
AuthSvc -> AuthSvc: jwt.verify(token, secret)
AuthSvc --> AuthCtrl: decoded payload
deactivate AuthSvc

AuthCtrl -> UserSvc: getUserById(userId)
activate UserSvc
UserSvc -> DB: SELECT user WHERE id=?
activate DB
DB --> UserSvc: user data
deactivate DB
deactivate UserSvc

AuthCtrl -> UserSvc: checkSessionActive(userId, token)
activate UserSvc
UserSvc -> DB: SELECT session WHERE userId=? AND token=? AND expiresAt > NOW()
activate DB
DB --> UserSvc: session active
deactivate DB
deactivate UserSvc

alt Token valide et session active
    AuthCtrl --> API: user authenticated
    deactivate AuthCtrl
    API -> DashboardCtrl: getDashboardData(userId)
    activate DashboardCtrl
    DashboardCtrl -> DB: SELECT dashboard data for user
    activate DB
    DB --> DashboardCtrl: dashboard data
    deactivate DB
    DashboardCtrl --> API: dashboard data
    deactivate DashboardCtrl
    API --> Frontend: dashboard data
    deactivate API
    Frontend --> User: Afficher dashboard
    deactivate Frontend
    
else Token invalide ou session expirée
    AuthCtrl --> API: 401 Unauthorized
    deactivate AuthCtrl
    API --> Frontend: authentication failed
    deactivate API
    Frontend -> Frontend: Rediriger vers login
    Frontend --> User: "Session expirée, veuillez vous reconnecter"
    deactivate Frontend
end

note over User, DB
    Chaque requête vers une ressource protégée 
    passe par cette validation de token
end note

@enduml